---
description: Branch per feature and commit at checkpoints
alwaysApply: true
---

# Git

- Branch off `main` for each feature or fix (`feat/…`, `fix/…`).
- Commit at checkpoints, not one dump at the end. Conventional Commits: `feat:`, `fix:`, `docs:`, `test:`, `ci:`.
- Never commit `.env`, secrets, or credentials. `.env.example` is the only env template.
- Do not force-push `main`.
